      "text": "Gentle hand exercises and warm water in the morning. I'm gonna send a referral to the rheumatology clinic. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Please come and see me in four weeks. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
